\mathrm{f}_{\mathrm{c}}=\frac{\mathrm{nv}}{4 \mathrm{I}_{\mathrm{c}}}=\frac{7 \mathrm{v}}{4 \mathrm{I}_{\mathrm{c}}}

For open organ pipe

\begin{aligned}
& f_o=\frac{n v}{21_o}=\frac{4 v}{21_o} \\
& \because f_c=f_o \\
& \frac{7 v}{41_c}=\frac{4 v}{21_o} \Rightarrow \frac{1_c}{1_o}=\frac{7}{8}
\end{aligned}
